border-transparent transition-colors font-medium\" href=\"#\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[15px]\"\u003ereceipt_long\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003e操作审计\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/nav\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c!-- 底部控制台操作 --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"p-3 border-t border-border-grid bg-[#0A0C10] space-y-2\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"p-2 bg-[#14161C] border border-border-grid rounded-[4px] flex items-center justify-between\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"text-[9.5px] font-mono text-gray-400\"\u003e自研小模型引擎\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-primary font-bold\"\u003ev1.8\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cbutton class=\"w-full py-1.5 px-2 bg-primary text-[#1A0B00] hover:bg-[#FFA155] border border-primary/40 rounded-[4px] text-[11px] font-mono font-bold flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 transition-all\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]\"\u003edescription\u003c/span\u003e\n        生成诊断报告\n      \u003c/button\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"text-[9px] font-mono text-gray-500 text-center flex items-center justify-center gap-1\"\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003eENGINE: ThermalNet-Mini\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-real\"\u003e● 已载入\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/aside\u003e\n\u003c!-- ==================== 2. 主视口内容区 (SCADA 40px网格工业背景) ==================== --\u003e\n\u003cmain class=\"flex-1 min-w-0 flex flex-col scada-grid-bg\"\u003e\n\u003c!-- 顶部工控全局操作栏 (Top Bar) --\u003e\n\u003cheader class=\"h-11 px-4 bg-[#0E1015]/90 border-b border-border-grid flex items-center justify-between gap-4 backdrop-blur-sm sticky top-0 z-30\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center gap-3 min-w-0\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-[12px] font-bold text-gray-200 tracking-tight font-sans whitespace-nowrap\"\u003e\n          SHAD 智慧供热异常检测与辅助诊断平台\n        \u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-gray-600\"\u003e|\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cdiv